  "title": "Schedule D (Capital Gains and Losses): required for this bounded class when the covered-long-term-gain eligible-transaction family (via its proceeds companion) is closed with at least one member; not required when closed-empty. Line 8a columns (d)/(e) itemize the eligible transactions; line 13 itemizes the accepted box-2a family (ADR-0050) unchanged. Line 8a column (h) and lines 15/16 are published by separate peer rules and are not itemized here (ADR-0052 Decision 3/4). The seven boundary declarations are value-checked (must equal \"yes\"), not merely present (ADR-0055 Decision 1).",
